00:27:52,209 --> 00:27:53,210
RIGHT.
OKAY.

676
00:27:53,210 --> 00:27:54,244
OKAY? GIVE ME A HUG.

677
00:27:55,679 --> 00:27:57,214
ALL RIGHTY, WORK IT.

678
00:28:06,890 --> 00:28:08,592
THERE ARE A TON
OF PEOPLE OUT THERE,

679
00:28:08,592 --> 00:28:11,261
LOTS OF ENERGY,
FAST WALKS.

680
00:28:11,261 --> 00:28:13,296
REMEMBER, THE FLOWERS
ARE A LITTLE SLIPPERY.

681
00:28:13,296 --> 00:28:15,198
I'VE GOT ONE CHANCE
TO DO THIS.

682
00:28:15,198 --> 00:28:17,634
THIS EMOTION
JUST RUNS THROUGH MY BODY.

683
00:28:17,634 --> 00:28:20,337
THIS IS REAL. LIKE, THIS IS
ABSOLUTELY REAL.

684
00:28:20,337 --> 00:28:21,905
MY HEART'S
CONSTANTLY RACING.

685
00:28:21,905 --> 00:28:23,807
WHEW. I NEED TO STAY CALM.

686
00:28:23,807 --> 00:28:25,575
THIS COULD BE
MY BREAKING POINT.

687
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:34,384
♪♪♪

688
00:28:42,959 --> 00:28:46,229
♪ NE-NA, NE-NA ♪

689
00:28:46,363 --> 00:28:47,964
♪♪♪

690
00:28:54,271 --> 00:28:55,939
YEAH!

691
00:28:55,939 --> 00:29:03,313
(woman singing in Thai)

692
00:29:07,684 --> 00:29:11,521
WE ARE AT THE GRAND FINALE--
THE LAST RUNWAY SHOW.

693
00:29:11,521 --> 00:29:13,390
THIS IS EITHER GONNA MAKE ME,
OR IT'S GONNA BREAK ME.

694
00:29:25,902 --> 00:29:27,304
YEAH, SHE DOES.

695
00:29:27,304 --> 00:29:28,305
VERY RELAXED, VERY NATURAL.

696
00:29:28,305 --> 00:29:32,209
♪♪♪

697
00:29:40,717 --> 00:29:44,254
OW!

698
00:29:44,254 --> 00:29:45,689
IT'S A VERY,
VERY HARD RUNWAY TO WALK,

699
00:29:45,689 --> 00:29:48,391
BECAUSE THEY HAVE FLOWERS
ON TOP OF THE RUNWAY.

700
00:29:48,391 --> 00:29:49,826
I HAD A FEW MOMENTS
WHERE I SLIPPED,

701
00:29:49,826 --> 00:29:52,529
BUT I DIDN'T LET THAT SHOW.

702
00:29:52,529 --> 00:29:53,497
WHOO!

703
00:29:55,499 --> 00:29:57,567
YAY!

704
00:29:57,567 --> 00:29:59,536
I'M STANDING THERE WAITING,
THE MUSIC'S GOIN',

705
00:29:59,536 --> 00:30:01,838
YOU SEE ALL THE MODELS
AHEAD OF YOU GOIN' OUT,

706
00:30:01,838 --> 00:30:03,940
I'M GOIN', "OH, MY GOD,
OH, MY GOD, THIS IS IT."

707
00:30:03,940 --> 00:30:06,443
TYRA IS WAITING.
YOU CAN'T GO BACK.

708
00:30:06,443 --> 00:30:08,411
GO.

709
00:30:08,411 --> 00:30:11,481
♪♪♪

710
00:30:15,785 --> 00:30:17,387
GIRL, YOU CANNOT
WALK THAT SLOW.

711
00:30:17,387 --> 00:30:18,722
- LOOK WHERE THEY ARE.
- SLIPPING.

712
00:30:18,722 --> 00:30:21,658
GO, GO, GO, GO, GO!

713
00:30:21,658 --> 00:30:24,528
♪♪♪

714
00:30:33,570 --> 00:30:34,804
WHOO!

715
00:30:34,804 --> 00:30:36,206
IT IS SO MUCH FUN OUT THERE.

716
00:30:36,206 --> 00:30:38,241
WE'RE ALL HOT.

717
00:30:38,241 --> 00:30:40,377
WE ARE LITERALLY
HOT AND SWEATING.

718
00:30:41,811 --> 00:30:43,346
WHOO!

719
00:30:45,415 --> 00:30:47,217
GO CHANGE,
GO CHANGE, GO CHANGE.

720
00:30:47,217 --> 00:30:48,952
I REALLY DON'T KNOW
HOW JOANIE'S DOIN',

721
00:30:48,952 --> 00:30:51,254
AND AT THIS POINT IN TIME,
HONESTLY,

722
00:30:51,254 --> 00:30:52,556
I REALLY DON'T CARE
HOW JOANIE'S DOIN',

723
00:30:52,556 --> 00:30:54,491
'CAUSE I'M FOCUSED
ON DANIELLE.

724
00:30:59,563 --> 00:31:01,731
GETTING DRESSED BACKSTAGE
IS LIKE A TORNADO.

725
00:31:01,731 --> 00:31:03,400
PEOPLE ARE PULLING
THINGS OUT OF MY HAIR

726
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,601
AND STICKING THINGS
IN MY EARS.

727
00:31:04,601 --> 00:31:06,736
THIS IS
YOUR LAST PASS, GIRLS.

728
00:31:06,736 --> 00:31:10,407
♪♪♪

729
00:31:16,580 --> 00:31:18,915
AS I'M ABOUT TO PASS BY
THE JUDGES,

730
00:31:18,915 --> 00:31:20,350
I'M GIVING THEM
MY FIERCEST WALK.

731
00:31:20,350 --> 00:31:22,485
FORGET ALL THE SLIPS
THAT I HAD.

732
00:31:22,485 --> 00:31:24,621
FORGET ME ALMOST
FALLIN' OFF THE RUNWAY.

733
00:31:24,621 --> 00:31:26,823
THIS IS MY TIME RIGHT NOW
IN FRONT OF THEM.

734
00:31:26,823 --> 00:31:29,726
♪♪♪

735
00:31:31,928 --> 00:31:33,830
(laughs)

736
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:35,966
♪♪♪

737
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:41,738
THIS IS IT--
YOUR LAST CHANCE

738
00:31:41,738 --> 00:31:43,940
TO BE IN FRONT OF THEM
OR TO LOOK THE BEST.

739
00:31:43,940 --> 00:31:45,742
IT WAS, LIKE,
"WHAT DO YOU WANT, JUDGES,

740
00:31:45,742 --> 00:31:47,377
ME OR HER?"

741
00:31:47,377 --> 00:31:48,912
THAT'S A GORGEOUS OUTFIT
FOR HER.

742
00:31:51,247 --> 00:31:53,717
THIS IS GONNA BE THE FINALE.

743
00:31:53,717 --> 00:31:56,219
SMILE, CLAP, LET'S GO.

744
00:31:56,219 --> 00:31:58,855
♪♪♪

745
00:32:07,497 --> 00:32:08,898
I AM AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

746
00:32:08,898 --> 00:32:09,966
THERE'S NO DOUBT
ABOUT IT.

747
00:32:09,966 --> 00:32:12,235
I FELT IT TODAY.

748
00:32:12,235 --> 00:32:13,937
I AM GOING TO BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

749
00:32:13,937 --> 00:32:17,807
♪♪♪

750
00:32:21,745 --> 00:32:23,680
OH, MY GOD!

751
00:32:25,849 --> 00:32:27,951
WHOO, GOT A LITTLE TEARY.

752
00:32:27,951 --> 00:32:30,353
- HOW WAS IT?
- AAH!

753
00:32:30,353 --> 00:32:31,688
THAT WAS WORKIN' IT.

754
00:32:31,688 --> 00:32:33,890
YOU WERE SLIPPIN',
BUT IT WAS COOL!

755
00:32:33,890 --> 00:32:36,626
YOU WERE SO GOOD, OOH!

756
00:32:36,626 --> 00:32:38,194
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU GIRLS.

757
00:32:38,194 --> 00:32:40,330
YOU GUYS LOOK LIKE MODELS.

758
00:32:40,330 --> 00:32:41,598
MM.

759
00:32:41,598 --> 00:32:44,200
OKAY, COME WITH ME, GIRLS.

760
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:47,804
TO WALK THAT RUNWAY TODAY
WAS WHAT I EXPECTED IT TO BE,

761
00:32:47,804 --> 00:32:49,472
AND EVEN MORE.

762
00:32:49,472 --> 00:32:52,342
JUST THE LOVE THAT I WAS
FEELING FROM THE AUDIENCE

763
00:32:52,342 --> 00:32:54,711
AND FROM THE JUDGES
WAS AMAZING.

764
00:32:54,711 --> 00:32:55,879
HI!

765
00:32:55,879 --> 00:32:57,714
- OH, YOU'RE SWEATING.
- OH, I KNOW.

766
00:32:57,714 --> 00:32:59,516
I COULDN'T SEE IT.

767
00:32:59,516 --> 00:33:00,884
THIS IS THE FIRST "TOP MODEL"
SHOW WHERE I WAS LIKE THIS.

768
00:33:02,886 --> 00:33:04,854
LOOK AT THAT.
SHE'S GONNA CRY AGAIN.

769
00:33:04,854 --> 00:33:06,322
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU,

770
00:33:06,322 --> 00:33:08,324
AND I'LL SEE YOU GUYS
SOON, OKAY?

771
00:33:08,324 --> 00:33:09,592
YOU KNOW, WHEN I SEE YOU,
I'LL BE LIKE THIS.

772
00:33:09,592 --> 00:33:11,394
I KNOW.

773
00:33:11,394 --> 00:33:13,396
AT THE RUNWAY,
SHE MADE ME CRY.

774
00:33:13,396 --> 00:33:14,731
I'M LIKE, "OH, MY GOSH,
THIS IS, LIKE,

775
00:33:14,731 --> 00:33:16,466
THE LAST THING IN
THE WHOLE COMPETITION.

776
00:33:16,466 --> 00:33:18,368
I FEEL REALLY GOOD."

777
00:33:21,705 --> 00:33:23,940
♪♪♪

778
00:33:23,940 --> 00:33:25,375
I'LL READ IT.

779
00:33:25,375 --> 00:33:27,811
"TOMORROW YOU WILL MEET
WITH THE JUDGES.

780
00:33:27,811 --> 00:33:30,814
ONLY ONE OF YOU WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

781
00:33:30,814 --> 00:33:32,582
I'VE BEEN WAITIN'
SO MANY MONTHS

782
00:33:32,582 --> 00:33:35,351
FOR THIS TIME RIGHT HERE,
AND I'M READY FOR IT.

783
00:33:35,351 --> 00:33:36,820
- IT'S CRAZY.
- YEAH.

784
00:33:36,820 --> 00:33:41,524
I'VE DONE A LOT TO BE HERE,
AND I-I-I WANT IT SO BAD.

785
00:33:41,524 --> 00:33:43,259
THERE CAN ONLY BE ONE.

786
00:33:43,259 --> 00:33:44,728
MM-HMM.

787
00:33:44,728 --> 00:33:48,398
♪♪♪

788
00:33:51,434 --> 00:33:52,869
- HI, JOANIE.
- HI.

789
00:33:52,869 --> 00:33:53,937
HI, DANIELLE.

790
00:33:53,937 --> 00:33:57,507
FIRST OF ALL, I WANNA
CONGRATULATE YOU BOTH.

791
00:33:57,507 --> 00:33:59,976
YOU'VE COME A LONG WAY.

792
00:33:59,976 --> 00:34:02,846
YOU, JOANIE, FROM
BEAVER FALLS, PENNSYLVANIA,

793
00:34:02,846 --> 00:34:05,648
AND YOU, DANIELLE, FROM
LITTLE ROCK, ARKANSAS,

794
00:34:05,648 --> 00:34:07,484
AND YOU'RE THE TWO FINALISTS.

795
00:34:07,484 --> 00:34:10,453
SO, TONIGHT WE WILL DECIDE

796
00:34:10,453 --> 00:34:15,225
WHO WILL BE AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

797
00:34:15,225 --> 00:34:17,392
YOU'VE HEARD THE PRIZES
EVERY SINGLE WEEK,

798
00:34:17,392 --> 00:34:20,196
AND ONE OF YOU
IS ABOUT TO RECEIVE THEM.

799
00:34:20,196 --> 00:34:23,867
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT WITH
TOP INTERNATIONAL MODELING

800
00:34:23,867 --> 00:34:26,236
MANAGEMENT COMPANY FORD MODELS,

801
00:34:26,236 --> 00:34:28,738
A SPREAD
IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE

802
00:34:28,738 --> 00:34:31,941
SHOT BY
WORLD-RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER
MR. GILLES BENSIMON,

803
00:34:31,941 --> 00:34:36,913
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT

804
00:34:36,913 --> 00:34:39,682
WITH COVERGIRL COSMETICS.

805
00:34:39,682 --> 00:34:41,818
SO NOW IT'S TIME FOR YOUR
INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS,

806
00:34:41,818 --> 00:34:45,288
AND WE'RE GOING TO START
WITH YOUR RUNWAY WALKS

807
00:34:45,288 --> 00:34:47,223
IN THE ISSUE FASHION SHOW,

808
00:34:47,223 --> 00:34:49,658
AND, DANIELLE,
YOU'RE UP FIRST.

809
00:34:51,727 --> 00:34:53,696
MISS J., DANIELLE
IS DOIN' YOUR WALK.

810
00:34:53,696 --> 00:34:56,666
I WAS LOOKIN' AT MYSELF
IN DRAG.

811
00:34:56,666 --> 00:34:58,434
DANIELLE,
LIKE A SEASONED PRO.

812
00:34:58,434 --> 00:35:00,203
YOUR LITTLE WINK TO ME,
I WASN'T SURE

813
00:35:00,203 --> 00:35:01,437
FOR A MOMENT THERE
BUT I WAS, LIKE,

814
00:35:01,437 --> 00:35:02,437
"HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

815
00:35:02,437 --> 00:35:03,540
IN THIS CIRCUMSTANCE,
IT WORKED."

816
00:35:03,540 --> 00:35:05,341
I ALMOST HAD
A LITTLE TEAR.

817
00:35:05,341 --> 00:35:06,576
YOU WERE JUST SO WONDERFUL.

818
00:35:06,576 --> 00:35:07,911
ONE THING
I WOULD HAVE LIKED TO SEE,

819
00:35:07,911 --> 00:35:09,779
A LITTLE MORE ALERTNESS
IN THE FACE.

820
00:35:09,779 --> 00:35:11,381
SOMETIMES YOU LOOKED
A LITTLE BORED.

821
00:35:11,381 --> 00:35:13,716
I WAS CONCENTRATING
ON NOT SLIPPING.

822
00:35:13,716 --> 00:35:15,652
YOU ARE THE GIRL
THAT'S ACCIDENT PRONE.

823
00:35:15,652 --> 00:35:17,287
I AM THAT GIRL.

824
00:35:17,287 --> 00:35:19,322
CRUTCHES, HOSPITAL--
THAT'S ME, YEAH.

825
00:35:19,322 --> 00:35:21,858
ALL RIGHT, JOANIE,
SO NOW IT'S TIME TO SEE YOU

826
00:35:21,858 --> 00:35:23,893
IN THE FASHION SHOW.

827
00:35:23,893 --> 00:35:25,595
I LOVE THE WALK.

828
00:35:25,595 --> 00:35:28,298
JOANIE, I THOUGHT YOUR WALK,
PARTICULARLY THE ONE

829
00:35:28,298 --> 00:35:29,866
WITH THE FEATHERS
IN YOUR HAIR...

830
00:35:29,866 --> 00:35:32,302
(gasps)
TOOK MY BREATH AWAY.

831
00:35:32,302 --> 00:35:34,337
WITH THE OTHER OUTFIT,
AT TIMES,

832
00:35:34,337 --> 00:35:35,772
IT LOOKED LIKE YOU WERE
WALKIN' IN THE MALL.

833
00:35:35,772 --> 00:35:37,674
I THOUGHT
YOUR WALK WAS FANTASTIC.

834
00:35:37,674 --> 00:35:39,275
MY PROBLEM WITH YOU,
JOANIE,

835
00:35:39,275 --> 00:35:40,810
WAS THE FACT THAT
YOU LOOKED DOWN TOO MUCH.

836
00:35:40,810 --> 00:35:42,712
PHOTOGRAPHERS, THEY WANNA
SNAP A SHOT OF YOU,

837
00:35:42,712 --> 00:35:44,214
AND IF YOU'RE LOOKIN'
DOWN AT THE GROUND,

838
00:35:44,214 --> 00:35:45,315
ALL YOU SEE IS,
LIKE, SHUT EYES.

839
00:35:45,315 --> 00:35:46,716
ALL RIGHTY.

840
00:35:46,716 --> 00:35:48,518
THE REASON WHY YOU'RE STANDING
IN FRONT OF US RIGHT NOW

841
00:35:48,518 --> 00:35:51,754
IS BECAUSE YOU TWO HAVE
DONE THE STRONGEST PICTURES

842
00:35:51,754 --> 00:35:53,923
IN THIS ENTIRE COMPETITION.

843
00:35:53,923 --> 00:35:57,627
SO WE'RE GONNA TAKE A LOOK
AT SOME OF YOUR BEST PHOTOS.

844
00:35:57,627 --> 00:35:59,662
THE VERY FIRST PHOTO SHOOT
THAT YOU DID WAS WHAT,

845
00:35:59,662 --> 00:36:00,930
- YOU REMEMBER THAT ONE?
- THE BALD.

846
00:36:00,930 --> 00:36:02,465
THE BALD PHOTOS.

847
00:36:03,967 --> 00:36:06,302
WITH DANIELLE,
YOUR EYE CONTACT WAS

848
00:36:06,302 --> 00:36:08,438
PARTICULARLY IMPRESSIVE TO ME,
'CAUSE YOU CONNECTED

849
00:36:08,438 --> 00:36:11,307
WITH THE CAMERA IN A WAY
THAT A NEW MODEL RARELY DOES.

850
00:36:11,307 --> 00:36:13,810
JOANIE'S EYES JUST SEAR
INTO YOUR SOUL.

851
00:36:13,810 --> 00:36:16,546
I MEAN, I CAN'T BELIEVE
THAT WAS YOUR FIRST PHOTOGRAPH.

852
00:36:16,546 --> 00:36:19,182
YOU GUYS WERE NOT JUST POSING
AS FAIRY TALE PRINCESSES,

853
00:36:19,182 --> 00:36:20,717
BUT YOU WERE FALLING,

854
00:36:20,717 --> 00:36:23,253
AND BOTH OF YOUR FACES
LOOKED TOTALLY IN CONTROL.

855
00:36:23,253 --> 00:36:25,455
I ACTUALLY PREFERRED
DANIELLE'S CLOSEUP,

856
00:36:25,455 --> 00:36:28,191
BUT I THINK JOANIE'S BODY
IN THIS IS EXTRAORDINARY.

857
00:36:28,191 --> 00:36:30,293
DANIELLE,
MY ISSUE AT THIS POINT,

858
00:36:30,293 --> 00:36:33,229
I WAS GETTING THE SAME LOOK
FROM YOU WEEK AFTER WEEK.

859
00:36:35,698 --> 00:36:38,735
ONE WEEK, YOU WERE
PUPPETS AND DOLLS.

860
00:36:38,735 --> 00:36:41,638
I LOVE THE BUSTED,
BROKEN DOWN DOLL LOOK.

861
00:36:41,638 --> 00:36:44,340
THESE TWO PICTURES ARE
THE STRONGEST OF THAT WEEK,

862
00:36:44,340 --> 00:36:46,476
BECAUSE YOU'RE DOING
A BLANK DOLL FACE,

863
00:36:46,476 --> 00:36:47,810
BUT AT THE SAME TIME,
YOU'RE STILL REMEMBERING

864
00:36:47,810 --> 00:36:49,412
THAT YOU'RE A MODEL.

865
00:36:49,412 --> 00:36:51,681
ON YOUR HEAD,
LIKE YOU HAVE A HEADACHE, OH.

866
00:36:51,681 --> 00:36:54,317
THE SAME WEEK, I DIRECTED YOU
IN A PHOTO SHOOT

867
00:36:54,317 --> 00:36:57,487
WHERE YOU HAD TO CRY.

868
00:36:57,487 --> 00:36:59,555
A SHOT LIKE THIS
IS ALL ABOUT THEATRICS,

869
00:36:59,555 --> 00:37:01,190
AND, JOANIE,
I BELIEVE YOU.

870
00:37:01,190 --> 00:37:02,926
IT LOOKS LIKE A STILL
OUT OF A MOVIE.

871
00:37:02,926 --> 00:37:05,595
DANIELLE JUST IS ELEGANT.

872
00:37:05,595 --> 00:37:07,797
I WOULD HAVE LOVED TO HAVE
SEEN A LITTLE MORE...

873
00:37:07,797 --> 00:37:09,399
SOMETHING BURNING.

874
00:37:09,399 --> 00:37:10,533
DANIELLE,
I THINK YOU'RE THINKING

875
00:37:10,533 --> 00:37:12,635
ABOUT YOUR BEAUTY MORE,
BUT STILL EMOTIONAL,

876
00:37:12,635 --> 00:37:14,270
AND JOANIE'S
FORGOTTEN ABOUT HER BEAUTY

877
00:37:14,270 --> 00:37:15,672
AND THINKING ABOUT
THE EMOTION.

878
00:37:15,672 --> 00:37:17,407
SO I JUST THINK
THEY'RE TWO DIFFERENT EMOTIONS,

879
00:37:17,407 --> 00:37:19,242
BUT TO ME, THEY STILL
EVOKE SADNESS.

880
00:37:21,411 --> 00:37:24,447
YOU HAD TO POSE
ON AN ELEPHANT.

881
00:37:24,447 --> 00:37:26,549
YOU GUYS ARE ALMOST LIKE
OPPOSITES OF ONE ANOTHER,

882
00:37:26,549 --> 00:37:28,584
FACING IN
THE OPPOSITE DIRECTION,

883
00:37:28,584 --> 00:37:29,852
LEGS GOING UP IN THE
OPPOSITE DIRECTION.

884
00:37:29,852 --> 00:37:31,587
BEAUTIFUL PICTURES, GIRLS.

885
00:37:31,587 --> 00:37:33,756
I'M LOOKING AT YOU AND NOT
THE ELEPHANT, AND THAT'S HARD.

886
00:37:33,756 --> 00:37:35,858
DANIELLE, TAKE US BACK TO
YOU BEING SICK THAT DAY.

887
00:37:35,858 --> 00:37:37,961
I WAS DEHYDRATED
AND HAD FOOD POISONING,

888
00:37:37,961 --> 00:37:40,530
SO I WAS WOOZY UP THERE
ON THE ELEPHANT

889
00:37:40,530 --> 00:37:42,699
AND KIND OF DIZZY,
BUT I WANTED TO GET A GOOD SHOT.

890
00:37:42,699 --> 00:37:45,401
YOU BOTH LOOK ACTUALLY VERY,
VERY COMFORTABLE UP THERE.

891
00:37:45,401 --> 00:37:48,204
THE ANIMAL
WAS SUCH A GENTLE ANIMAL,

892
00:37:48,204 --> 00:37:49,372
AND I REALLY DID BOND
WITH IT.

893
00:37:49,372 --> 00:37:50,606
AW.

894
00:37:50,606 --> 00:37:53,209
THE NEXT PHOTO SHOOT
THAT YOU DID

895
00:37:53,209 --> 00:37:55,845
WAS WITH THE NOTED
NIGEL BARKER.

896
00:37:55,845 --> 00:37:57,880
YOU BOTH MAKE
THE SUN COME OUT

897
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:59,215
WHEN I TAKE PICTURES.

898
00:37:59,215 --> 00:38:00,683
DANIELLE IS QUITE SEXY.

899
00:38:00,683 --> 00:38:02,352
LOOK HOW DIFFERENT
JOANIE LOOKED.

900
00:38:02,352 --> 00:38:04,687
THIS PICTURE BLEW ME
AWAY, JOANIE, ACTUALLY.

901
00:38:04,687 --> 00:38:07,423
AND YOUR VERY LAST
PHOTO SHOOT.

